  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Deployment Strategy Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Deployment Strategy Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Deploy vs Release",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Deploy== = code lands on servers",
                "==Release== = users can see it",
                "Feature flags and traffic shifting split the two"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Zero-Downtime Needs Three Things",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Health check",
                    "sub": "gates traffic",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Graceful shutdown",
                    "sub": "drain in-flight requests",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Side by side",
                    "sub": "old and new versions coexist",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Strategy Trade-offs",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Trade-offs: cost, speed, rollback time, blast radius",
                "==Blast radius== = share of users hit by a bad release"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Strategy (safer ↓)",
                "Blast radius",
                "Cost"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Recreate",
                  "{red:100%}",
                  "1x"
                ],
                [
                  "Rolling",
                  "growing share",
                  "1x+"
                ],
                [
                  "Blue-green",
                  "0% until switch",
                  "**~2x**, the most"
                ],
                [
                  "Canary",
                  "{green:1-5%}",
                  "small extra slice"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Common Mistake",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Green CI is not safe",
              "text": "Safety comes from ==health checks==, ==metrics gates== and a tested rollback path."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Deploy vs release?** Servers vs users.",
                "**Zero-downtime needs?** Health gate, drain, compatible versions.",
                "**Costliest strategy?** Blue-green, ~2x."
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Recreate and Rolling Updates",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Recreate and Rolling Updates",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Recreate",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Stop **all** old instances, then start the new ones",
                "==Downtime==, but never two versions at once",
                "Suits {blue:breaking schema changes} and dev environments"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Rolling Update",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Replace instances in small batches",
                "`maxSurge`: extra pods allowed",
                "`maxUnavailable`: pods allowed down",
                "==maxUnavailable: 0== keeps full capacity",
                "{green:Readiness probe}: no traffic to unready pods",
                "`preStop` sleep + `terminationGracePeriodSeconds` drain connections"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Start v2 pod",
                    "sub": "maxSurge",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Readiness passes",
                    "sub": "gets traffic",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Drain v1 pod",
                    "sub": "preStop + grace",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Stop v1 pod",
                    "sub": "next batch",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Commands",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "bash",
              "lines": [
                "kubectl set image deploy/app app=img:v2",
                "kubectl rollout status deploy/app",
                "kubectl rollout undo deploy/app",
                "kubectl rollout history deploy/app"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "v1 and v2 overlap",
              "text": "During a rolling update both versions serve traffic together. Incompatible ==APIs, schemas or cache formats== break requests mid-rollout."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Blue-Green and Canary Releases",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Blue-Green and Canary Releases",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Blue-Green",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Two full environments: blue is live, green is idle",
                "Deploy and test green, then ==flip== router, load balancer or Service selector",
                "Rollback = flip back, **no redeploy**",
                "Cost: ~==2x infrastructure== during switch",
                "Shared DB must fit **both** versions; only the app tier is duplicated"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Deploy green",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Test green",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Flip router",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Flip back",
                    "sub": "rollback",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Canary",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "1%",
                    "sub": "metrics gate",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "5%",
                    "sub": "metrics gate",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "25%",
                    "sub": "metrics gate",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "100%",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Each step: compare ==error rate==, ==latency p99==, business metrics vs baseline",
                "Breach → ==automatic abort== and rollback"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Tool",
                "Role"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Istio VirtualService",
                  "weighted routing"
                ],
                [
                  "ALB weighted target groups",
                  "weighted routing"
                ],
                [
                  "Argo Rollouts, Flagger",
                  "automated analysis, promotion"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Common Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Too little canary traffic or no automated metrics gate proves nothing",
                "{red:Sticky sessions} pin users to one version",
                "Stale blue kept running long after cutover"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Canary needs a **metrics gate**; blue-green needs a DB both versions accept."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Feature Flags and Dark Launches",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Feature Flags and Dark Launches",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Flag Basics",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`if flags.isEnabled('new-checkout', user)` = ==runtime switch==",
                "Decouples **deploy** from **release**",
                "Flag off = ==rollback==, no redeploy"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Type",
                "Life",
                "Example"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Release",
                  "short",
                  "new checkout"
                ],
                [
                  "Ops kill switch",
                  "long",
                  "disable payments"
                ],
                [
                  "Experiment",
                  "A/B",
                  "button colour"
                ],
                [
                  "Permission",
                  "long",
                  "admin tools"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Dark Launch and Ramp",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Deploy",
                    "sub": "rolling, flag off",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dark launch",
                    "sub": "shadow traffic",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Compare",
                    "sub": "old vs new",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Ramp",
                    "sub": "1%, 10%, 50%, 100%",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Targeting: ==percentage==, user segment, internal users first",
                "Evaluate a ==stable user hash== so each user stays consistent"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Flag Debt",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Old release flags leave dead branches and untested combos",
                "No owner or expiry date",
                "No safe default when the flag service is down"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Remove release flags after 100%. Give each an ==owner== and ==expiry==; default to the **safe** state."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Why flags?** Deploy and release split; off is rollback.",
                "**Dark launch?** Hidden prod run; compare before users see it.",
                "**Why hash users?** Consistent experience per user."
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Zero-Downtime Database Migrations",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Zero-Downtime Database Migrations",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Safe Change Flow",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Schema must stay ==backward compatible== with running code",
                "Old and new app versions share the **same database** mid-rollout"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Expand",
                    "sub": "add nullable column",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dual-write",
                    "sub": "write both, read old",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Backfill",
                    "sub": "in batches",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Switch reads",
                    "sub": "to new column",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Contract",
                    "sub": "drop old, later release",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Rename a column = the same five steps; a direct `RENAME` breaks old code instantly"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Avoid Long Locks",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Postgres: ==CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY==",
                "Backfill in small batches",
                "Set `lock_timeout`",
                "MySQL: ==gh-ost== or ==pt-online-schema-change=="
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "sql",
              "lines": [
                "SET lock_timeout = '2s';",
                "CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY idx_users_email ON users (email);"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Common Mistake",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Order matters",
              "text": "`DROP COLUMN`, `NOT NULL` without default or a type change in the same release as the code leaves rollback no schema. Ship ==additive== migrations first and separately; drop or narrow columns only in a **later release**, once no running code uses them."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Why not RENAME directly?** Old code still uses the old name and fails at once.",
                "**When drop the old column?** A later release, once no running code uses it."
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
